# --- Cluster storage symlinks (Vulcan) -------------------------------------
# On Vulcan the bulk data lives on /project and the repo reaches it by symlink, so the
# pipeline's relative paths (data/phenobase_inat_data/...) resolve unchanged.
# NOTE: `data/` and `models/` above have TRAILING SLASHES, which match directories only --
# a symlink is not a directory to gitignore, so those entries do NOT cover the cluster
# layout. These slash-less duplicates do. Without them `git status` on Vulcan reports
# `?? data`, `?? models` and a stray commit would bake /project paths into the repo.
data
models
jobout
manifests
